# The build context is sent to the Docker daemon in full on every build. Without this,
# that is ~204 MB (191 MB of it node_modules) for an image that runs its own `npm ci`
# anyway. Excluding the waste brings it to roughly 1 MB, which matters a lot when the
# daemon is on a NAS rather than a local SSD.

node_modules
**/node_modules

.git
.gitignore

# Build outputs — regenerated inside the image.
dist
**/dist
dist-embed
*.tsbuildinfo

# Design corpus and tests: not needed to build or run the app.
docs
e2e
playwright-report
test-results

# Local environment and editor state.
.env
**/.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

*.log
npm-debug.log*
